{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;After Friday&quot; is a psychological horror game where tension builds through atmosphere and exploration rather than combat or jump-scares. There are no monsters to fight\u2014just the unsettling feeling that something is off. You\u2019ll find yourself walking through eerie environments, slowly uncovering a deeper secret. It\u2019s a journey into the unknown\u2014or perhaps, into a familiar place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game evolved from the <i>Taptap Spotlight Game Jam</i>. After receiving positive feedback and seeing how much people connected with the concept, I decided to develop it into a complete game. It\u2019s been a rewarding journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Finally, I truly hope you enjoy playing it, and I hope she is ok.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604140?t=1743169930","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3604140?t=1743169930","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604140/afce344c0ff9b40f379b65badb317b8beb6b9088/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743169930","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604140/afce344c0ff9b40f379b65badb317b8beb6b9088/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743169930","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"This game contains themes of mental distress, self-harm, and suggestive content. Some scenes may be unsettling or uncomfortable for certain players. Viewer discretion is advised."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">&quot;After Friday&quot; is a psychological horror game where tension builds through atmosphere and exploration rather than combat or jump-scares. There are no monsters to fight\u2014just the unsettling feeling that something is off. You\u2019ll find yourself walking through eerie environments, slowly uncovering a deeper secret. It\u2019s a journey into the unknown\u2014or perhaps, into a familiar place.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game evolved from the <i>Taptap Spotlight Game Jam</i>. After receiving positive feedback and seeing how much people connected with the concept, I decided to develop it into a complete game. It\u2019s been a rewarding journey.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Finally, I truly hope you enjoy playing it, and I hope she is ok.</p>","developers":["Sw33tSaNity"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3604140/1fc178586d287bc69ae8ca02417100818da98931/header.jpg?t=1743169930","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257117079,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117079/movie480.mp4?t=1743169925","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117079/movie_max.mp4?t=1743169925"},"name":"IHearSomeone","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257117079/29ccd3209df70b1b49cb1466b04af201c27ce474/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1743169925","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117079/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1743169925","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257117079/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1743169925"}},{"highlight":true,"id":257118422,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118422/movie480.mp4?t=1743169928","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257118422/movie_max.mp4?t=174316992